Icons in this folder (public/icons/nav/) are from Microsoft Fluent Emoji (3D style),
resized to 96x96 PNG. No other changes.

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/fluentui-emoji (MIT License)
  home.png    <- assets/House/3D/house_3d.png
  deals.png   <- assets/Fire/3D/fire_3d.png
  buy.png     <- assets/Magnifying glass tilted left/3D/magnifying_glass_tilted_left_3d.png
  share.png   <- assets/Handshake/3D/handshake_3d.png
  my.png      <- assets/Office building/3D/office_building_3d.png
  signup.png  <- assets/Memo/3D/memo_3d.png

